    "abstract": "Parts figure for the aft fuselage frames and their feet in the bilge area, covering the cleat and shear tie standard, the doubler and the grommet and fastener detail at a typical frame station.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the frame, frame foot, cleat and shear tie items in the bilge area of the aft fuselage, together with the grommet and fastener detail at each station.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows a typical frame station looking forward; the frames between the working stations are identical apart from their web depth. One item is called out per position across the whole bilge area, and the quantities are the totals for the station range. Grommet items are called out per systems penetration and the count varies by aircraft."
    },
